import{_ as i,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 318 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Immortalization-Road Setting: Shrouding's Version of Plundering Other Realms' Origin","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 318 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Immortalization-Road Setting: Shrouding's Version of Plundering Other Realms' Origin","no":318,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Immortalization Road","Plundering Other Realms","Origin Contest","Anti-Predation Axiom"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","18-Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0318_模块2-遮天-成仙路设定.md","filePath":"en/0318_模块2-遮天-成仙路设定.md"}`),a={name:"en/0318_模块2-遮天-成仙路设定.md"};function s(r,e,l,m,h,d){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-318-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-immortalization-road-setting-shrouding-s-version-of-plundering-other-realms-origin" tabindex="-1">Entry 318 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Immortalization-Road Setting: Shrouding&#39;s Version of Plundering Other Realms&#39; Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-318-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-immortalization-road-setting-shrouding-s-version-of-plundering-other-realms-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 318 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Immortalization-Road Setting: Shrouding&#39;s Version of Plundering Other Realms&#39; Origin&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 31) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 18, 15</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-so-called-immortalization-road-is-dividing-the-whole-cosmos-as-resources" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The so-called immortalization road is dividing the whole cosmos as resources <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-so-called-immortalization-road-is-dividing-the-whole-cosmos-as-resources" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The so-called immortalization road is dividing the whole cosmos as resources&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>anti-predation axiom</strong> is this entry&#39;s core — develop increments, do not consume stock; do not use slaughter-predation as the evolution path. This entry dissects Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;immortalization road&quot; setting: the quotas for immortalization are limited; strong ones slaughter across the cosmos for them; essentially &quot;immortalization&quot; is designed as a cross-star-region zero-sum resource predation. The law-first axiom requires: zero-sum cultivation is old Heavenly Dao, not an axiom. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Immortalization road&#39;s energy waste:</p><ul><li>Strong ones erupt in cosmos-tier war to fight limited quotas; energy consumed in mutual slaughter</li><li>Immortalization quotas monopolized by a few strong ones; ordinary cultivators excluded from the start</li><li>To fight for quotas, resources across the cosmos are prematurely consumed in war preparation</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Immortalization road&#39;s zero-sum design necessarily creates regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Quota scarcity law</strong>: immortalization quotas set as limited, equivalent to announcing at cosmic scale &quot;immortalization is a few people&#39;s privilege&quot;</li><li><strong>Strong ones&#39; melee period</strong>: around immortalization road&#39;s opening, strong ones slaughter, civilization energy zeroes</li><li><strong>Winner takes all</strong>: the immortalizer takes away all opportunities; non-immortalizers have nothing</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s process through the immortalization road is typical of plundering other realms&#39; Origin:</p><ul><li><strong>Quota exclusive</strong>: the immortalization quota Ye Fan gets means other same-generation strong ones lose the chance</li><li><strong>Other-realm resources</strong>: the immortalization road involves cross-star-region, cross-plane resource contest; what Ye Fan&#39;s side &quot;takes&quot; is what other planes lose</li><li><strong>Zero-sum world-view</strong>: the world-view has no &quot;expand immortalization quotas&quot; increment thinking, defaults the cake is that big</li></ul><p>Immortalization-road zero-sum also has a deep psychological mechanism: it unifies Myriad Ranks&#39; hope on &quot;grabbing quotas,&quot; so Myriad Ranks stop thinking &quot;why are quotas limited.&quot; When everyone is slaughtering over limited quotas, no one has time to ask &quot;can quotas become more&quot; — this is precisely zero-sum design&#39;s greatest success: it makes the oppressed slaughter each other, thereby not questioning the oppression itself. Heng Yuan Zhou developing increment Origin essentially breaks this psychological mechanism: let Myriad Ranks see the cake can grow, so they stop fighting each other. This is civilization awakening from &quot;grabbing the cake&quot; to &quot;baking the cake.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Immortalization-Road Zero-Sum</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Immortalization quotas limited</td><td>Develop increment Origin, everyone has a road</td></tr><tr><td>Strong ones slaughter over quotas</td><td>Myriad Ranks republican co-build, no slaughter needed</td></tr><tr><td>Plunder other realms&#39; Origin</td><td>Do not consume stock, cross-plane only transmits knowledge back</td></tr><tr><td>Winner takes all</td><td>Joint contracting, more work more gain</td></tr><tr><td>Immortalization is a few people&#39;s privilege</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Shrouding immortalization-road quotas and contest wars</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;developing increment Origin makes quotas unlimited&quot; vs. &quot;maintain zero-sum&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: strong-one war frequency, total immortalizers, Myriad-Rank immortalization rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — under zero-sum design immortalization rate is extremely low and accompanied by great war; after increment development immortalization rate rises several times and no war</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency</strong>: medium-low — quota count fluctuates with plot</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: medium-high — quota count serves whether Ye Fan can smoothly immortalize</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: medium — Ye Fan&#39;s immortalization depends on him winning the zero-sum contest</li></ul><p>Immortalization-road zero-sum also creates a &quot;fate narrative&quot;: strong ones fight for immortality as if it is Heavenly Dao&#39;s destined cycle. But Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom requires asking: who designed this cycle? Why are quotas limited? When everyone takes zero-sum as Heaven&#39;s will, no one asks whether Heaven&#39;s will can be modified. Ye Fan accepted the immortalization road&#39;s zero-sum rules, so all his effort is within the &quot;grabbing&quot; frame. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is to step out of the &quot;grabbing&quot; frame and ask: why can&#39;t everyone immortalize?</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: strong-one wars, war-preparation consumption, winner takes all</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: zero-sum quotas + plundering other realms&#39; Origin, is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s direct opposite</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least does not do cross-star-region plunder; Shrouding pushes plunder to cosmic scale</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: quotas monopolized by human top oligarchs, Myriad Ranks excluded</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: zero-sum predation logic cannot support cross-multiverse symbiosis</li></ul><p>Immortalization-road zero-sum is also deeply tied to &quot;lifespan anxiety.&quot; In Shrouding-the-Heavens world strong ones have limited lifespan, so the immortalization road becomes the only lifespan-extending hope — this gives zero-sum contest survival anxiety. Heng Yuan Zhou through life-circulation-system public fundamentally releases lifespan anxiety; when lifespan is no longer a problem, immortalization road&#39;s zero-sum contest loses its motive.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The immortalization road is not Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;grand epic,&quot; but proof it cannot imagine &quot;immortalization need not be grabbed.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is simple: make the cake bigger, not grab the cake.</p><p>Immortalization-road zero-sum&#39;s cleverest part is keeping Myriad Ranks busy fighting each other, so they do not ask why quotas are limited. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: make quotas more, make the cake bigger.</p><p>Immortalization-road zero-sum also turns &quot;immortalization&quot; from a natural evolution into a political transaction — who is qualified to be on the road is distributed by strong ones at the negotiating table. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Races republicanism requires: whether there is a road, who can be on it, is decided by Myriad-Rank consensus, not strong ones splitting the spoils.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · immortalization-road setting described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./291_模块2-遮天-叶凡掠夺思维拆解.html">Entry 291 · Ye Fan Predatory Thinking</a> · <a href="./319_模块2-遮天-宇宙战场.html">Entry 319 · Cosmic Battlefield</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const c=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,c as default};
